{"created": "2026-11-19T03:18:18.652244+00:00", "modified": "2026-11-19T03:18:18.979459+00:00", "id": 24358067, "conceptrecid": "24358066", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.24358067", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.24358066", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24358067", "metadata": {"title": "patoangolano/bio-stack: Enamel-Gene Relics in Birds and Turtles \u2014 bioRxiv Preprint Archival Release (v1.0.0)", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.24358067", "publication_date": "2026-11-19", "description": "<p>Archival release of the reproducible comparative genomics pipeline, verified datasets, publication figures, supplementary tables (<code>Table_S1</code>\u2013<code>Table_S6</code>), and bioRxiv preprint manuscript:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Unannotated Enamel-Gene Relics on the Avian Z Chromosome, Disordered-Protein Homology Bias, and Phylogenetic Limits of Inactivating-Mutation Dating in Birds and Turtles</strong>\nMatheus Lima (Independent Researcher, Brazil \u00b7 ORCID: <a href=\"https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3557-8337\">0009-0000-3557-8337</a>)</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>Included in this Archival Release (<code>enamel-relics-v1.0.0</code>)</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Preprint PDF:</strong> <code>submission_biorxiv/manuscript_biorxiv.pdf</code> (Typst <code>0.15.1</code>, continuous line and page numbering, 320 DPI figures, 46/46 verified primary references; SHA-256 <code>f768fb366ce07965...</code>).</li>\n<li><strong>Deterministic Pipeline (<code>scripts/enamel_relics/</code>):</strong> end-to-end scripts (<code>01_audit_and_fetch.py</code> through <code>06_make_figures.py</code>), pinned tool versions (<code>runs/enamel_relics/tool_versions.txt</code>), deterministic permutation seed (<code>20261017</code>), and provenance log (<code>runs/enamel_relics/provenance_run.jsonl</code>).</li>\n<li><strong>Supplementary Tables (<code>submission_biorxiv/supplementary/</code>):</strong> <code>Table_S1</code> through <code>Table_S6</code> (10 <code>.tsv</code> files + <code>MANIFEST_SHA256.tsv</code>), also attached as <code>enamel_relics_supplementary_tables.zip</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>Figures (<code>submission_biorxiv/figures/</code>):</strong> Figures 1\u20133 in vector <code>.svg</code>, vector <code>.pdf</code>, and 320 DPI <code>.png</code> (Okabe-Ito colorblind-safe palette).</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>Created specifically for permanent archival and Zenodo DOI minting prior to bioRxiv submission.</em></p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "patoangolano", "affiliation": null}], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "https://github.com/patoangolano/bio-stack/tree/enamel-relics-v1.0.0", "relation": "isSupplementTo", "resource_type": "software", "scheme": "url"}], "version": "enamel-relics-v1.0.0", "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/patoangolano/bio-stack"}, "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "24358066"}}]}}, "title": "patoangolano/bio-stack: Enamel-Gene Relics in Birds and Turtles \u2014 bioRxiv Preprint Archival Release (v1.0.0)", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24358067", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/24358067", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/24358067?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24358067", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24358067", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.24358067", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24358067/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24358066", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/24358066", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24358066", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.24358066", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:24358067/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:24358067/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org